# Parchment -- a light palette, for reading by daylight
#
# The one that is not a dark theme. Everything is inverted: a colour now
# has to get *darker* to be seen, so the whole lightness curve is turned
# over and the saturation lifted to stop the darker end going to mud.
# Worth having if you play in a bright room, where a black screen is a
# mirror.

name    Parchment
blurb   Ink on old paper. Lamp not included.

# --- interface roles -------------------------------------------------------
ui      canvas      EDE2CC
ui      panel       E0D2B6
ui      border      B39F7C
ui      title       7A4A18
ui      text        2C2418
ui      muted       7A6E58
ui      accent      9A5A1E
ui      selection   D8C49A  D0

